Package: runDGE
Title: Reproducible Differential Gene Expression with DESeq2
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("J.", "R.", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jr530@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Validates RNA-seq expression matrices and experiment designs, runs
    DESeq2 for raw counts or limma-trend for normalized expression, optionally
    adjusting for a design column named batch.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
